      "hash": "1954409637324f1c3f2cab102211fd161a6cd1c270252fc2e1297a69ab9a446b"
    },
    {
      "id": "960b3151a7a3229910c5eb3f4ba858e4aa80ac84bc42cf4ebcac3b02493e1ec3",
      "text": "Prefix cache",
      "hash": "6d2f1e1fefb634a9d9c07247312a3bd2471f20af5deb07dff137143ede4f3810"
    },
    {
      "id": "1b170b21a5d51d9bb19478c09d0d5b97edd7bcaf81412c53552f49ee092621d0",
      "text": "The provider-side store that lets consecutive requests skip re-processing a shared prefix, billing those tokens at a lower rate.",
      "hash": "b820ee4e01d58e4eb8e549f1d16545d3e2c750278b27cc57edfff8a643a533d3"
    },
    {
      "id": "7ae7ba222e22d9579751e95a299643085afaf3e384452b0e3ee7e885c6d7d564",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "91b367a1742c51db1b281aea240e66c9650848fc88b0faf7f0902539a4481717",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "27347f6305e14b0b5ff9e60dc30f0cc95eea7e40295fd629764b643200a25c8e",
      "text": "The",
      "hash": "b344d80e24a3679999fa964450b34bc24d1578a35509f934c1418b0a20d21a67"
    },
    {
      "id": "eec55ada7475335e6eab210841ee7df72e19feb70a3081340a3aff34bf94ff0c",
      "text": "-side store that lets consecutive",
      "hash": "7f7b4851e3bd61838b15b0b037dc59cb9266bc488665ea26b5ac51bc0cf5b535"
    },
    {
      "id": "8b45b0b222f123d778edf86371674f059282f527b08d262b10c32ef1ea6ad175",
      "text": "model provider requests",
      "hash": "08d711616fef85ef9059cc46b7a84267d6c19dfaee59ccad9095e7d25528b21c"
    },
    {
      "id": "1afc549c2a7eb68aaf89ad80c3d2bffc959ea84a2da2c24c58a997d133aacd46",
      "text": "skip re-processing a shared prefix. When the start of a request matches the start of a recent one — same",
      "hash": "1f1d81403502702c28f550ac2817178bc6e3f7537a439eb2a13844cdbe543566"
    },
    {
      "id": "180d24a54f18dfa1486edf6906f1c458bede369592eeca157e3b93d89026cb56",
      "text": "system prompt",
      "hash": "e16202309c92180728dd7fd1c59f16004a6d5ee245538c28d2a9a22edf2dd2ab"
    },
    {
      "id": "12ebbba2fee761a294f378a31abc7037d661a9b43e2d6a03c1bec09a49e38de1",
      "text": ", same history up to some point — the provider reuses its prior work and bills those",
      "hash": "b33acbe7554f655c560d5b6f2c25fe4f814add81d7844c87796df1671fbd385c"
    },
    {
      "id": "dfb03e22bcffbad1a0b483f9637bc6c52592a4bb1b13473d2e80dbea84aa4f49",
      "text": "cache tokens",
      "hash": "9d6973a6233e47e8c93d6f72c3583d2b9f8713c9279c9cdc512e3478bcb1709d"
    },
    {
      "id": "1d180c01285b4738f855ee7227550b9b56a5afb9f12d19246bd9829c39c42771",
      "text": "at a much lower rate.",
      "hash": "80025271b80de6c7c9dce2a8b6fac886c11034544b19b4a8c72cb23ea78c3d12"
    },
    {
      "id": "01b08074793ea704ba9158ce1658acd8c0788a8559d6fd5a68fc9f4167883a82",
      "text": "The cache pays off because sessions grow append-only. Every request re-sends the whole history as",
      "hash": "2a16fd1394bb58017b5a56f39548286e31d6218002f04b76c3ccce200aa9c19a"
    },
    {
      "id": "7526ba5512959223b2d011f39a36176801a57680921705f94765f2380874a403",
      "text": "input tokens",
      "hash": "f0c1cb4cda1985a408b12908c01227b01065a8cdfc2a03e2106ca60275f27d16"
    },
    {
      "id": "8d3e6747e795f51068decef99818349d5479282e12f9465afbdea5cd83887349",
      "text": "(see that entry for why), and in a normal",
      "hash": "b2cdf2d946d8198121f119c297a6da5b75660eb8393b924046eb13682ef482a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "22cb8f3429a9cde46faaeb346193b09c849964641062b8f90642aa79223c4bc0",
      "text": "the history only changes at the end — each request is the previous one plus a few new messages. The provider processes the long shared beginning once, stores the result, and picks up from where the prefix ends. Without the cache, a 50-",
      "hash": "29d15e2ec095bc005a8a67c176d099c1717beff1ec5c118cb2c1d26b8134294f"
    },
    {
      "id": "12a0c7d1d7a832ca1d3e468a1d06bd0fbcc5fbb3e3b21f9c4c0c9349f1c272c2",
      "text": "session would pay to re-process turn one fifty times.",
      "hash": "4e351e098f40793c64c448e769eb6f31699ce3c0497d429867e651796e19580a"
    },
    {
      "id": "1b51418f5270fc9c785168215fae9d250a05ff5286afb4be54161baadac34367",
      "text": "Caches also expire. How long an entry stays warm varies per model provider — typically minutes, not hours. Leave a session idle past the window and the next request rebuilds the prefix at full price once before caching resumes. This is mostly a",
      "hash": "db33480432949aa54a678294bc45af107b4d860c33e9da5e131db1aa1aed572e"
    },
    {
      "id": "082c96478312c63759401456ee4156b84c47fcb9a8e4f828b357c7ccec5cf8a7",
      "text": "builder's concern; as a user, the visible effect is that requests after a long pause cost more than the ones before it.",
      "hash": "a9d23121d2129a8fd4e0c9bfb6514cd35ef3d9d1f9636fff6f1b9ed5dbfcee7f"
    },
    {
      "id": "1e7678b2ab141811a7cdcc24d33d313f169f5109ae16f0237c0b7d8f66059846",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "f33343ee4fd47d5f8f90a153e12b0dfcc5753ef0fa5680c2cf4601d75ef4597f",
      "text": "\"Why did the bill spike halfway through the session?\"",
      "hash": "fcf01a43d1a91e551c6e38edef2da672e20434f040f2b3ee21461cf2b8f3b688"
    },
    {
      "id": "aae367d9bc3a21279b7d001e76c3bc3e407457c56b4c997e669c3e82149879ec",
      "text": "\"Harness started injecting the current time into the system prompt every turn. Prefix cache breaks at the first changed token, so every request after that billed at full rate.\"",
      "hash": "8216a65675a7b800d33e832ed28318cb7d0f9bfc56d360f2e75b143b57a07b82"
    },
    {
      "id": "74ec453547732d7e0a74be895d5ebdcb3e5987658eae8490d19e9ec922803824",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "7b31b84732a5d94c6e5feb28aa02ac5163dfea8ed8e43995c424daef31f8cf8a",
      "text": "Output tokens",
      "hash": "a9b50ea0c4a7e3469e7ac21e5497c3b11159a5968330807180eba6b5f0f36bfa"
    },
    {
      "id": "63dc28d103c25513d90bb9699698802ee04b0ca75edd0532c384c332dc694ce0",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "8e48f1eb8914dd80130e9a141d1543b359d7558192a204fe2699b2e896d7d83b",
      "text": "Cache tokens",
      "hash": "cce47e61662627e3233cc32f7d9c15df14bdb29e105265edb1add04660d4dc43"
    },
    {
      "id": "988890cd781dbd41ef58bdd24ec504eb7d29aab1e0929949a6616e9dacf161bc",
      "text": "Want more than vocabulary?",
      "hash": "5d5500a083006a1606e84a03c018904d01364631c6baea4c7a3f8f3f62bf94dc"
    },
